azahar: azahar (Wii U Emulator)
azahar:
azahar: Azahar is an open-source 3DS emulator project based on Citra.
azahar:
azahar: It was created from the merging of PabloMK7's Citra fork and the
azahar: Lime3DS project, both of which emerged shortly after Citra was
azahar: taken down.
azahar:
azahar: The goal of this project is to be the de-facto platform for
azahar: future development.
